      "widgets_values": [
        "## Montagio · Film music\n\nAn instrumental track for a film: ACE-Step 1.5 turbo, 8 steps; the length and the seed are written in two places each (latent and language model).\n\n**Tip:** Lyrics stay `[Instrumental]` for a track with no voice.\n\n**Models**, under `ComfyUI/models/`:\n- `diffusion_models/acestep_v1.5_turbo.safetensors` (MIT, from ACE-Step/Ace-Step1.5)\n- `text_encoders/qwen_0.6b_ace15.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B)\n- `text_encoders/qwen_1.7b_ace15.safetensors` (MIT, from ACE-Step/Ace-Step1.5)\n- `vae/ace_1.5_vae.safetensors` (MIT, from ACE-Step/Ace-Step1.5)\n\nCore nodes only. 60 s of music in 9.5 s warm on an NVIDIA L4 (24 GB), peak 10 to 14.6 GB.\n\nOpen weights only: every file is Apache-2.0 or MIT, pinned by sha256 in Montagio's `registry/models.lock.yaml`."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Montagio · Film music\n\nAn instrumental track for a film: ACE-Step 1.5 turbo, 8 steps; the length and the seed are written in two places each (latent and language model).\n\n**Tip:** Lyrics stay `[Instrumental]` for a track with no voice.\n\n**Models**, under `ComfyUI/models/`:\n- `diffusion_models/acestep_v1.5_turbo.safetensors` (MIT, from ACE-Step/Ace-Step1.5)\n- `text_encoders/qwen_0.6b_ace15.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B)\n- `text_encoders/qwen_1.7b_ace15.safetensors` (MIT, from ACE-Step/Ace-Step1.5)\n- `vae/ace_1.5_vae.safetensors` (MIT, from ACE-Step/Ace-Step1.5)\n\nCore nodes only. 60 s of music in 9.5 s warm on an NVIDIA L4 (24 GB), peak 10 to 14.6 GB.\n\nOpen weights only: every file is Apache-2.0 or MIT, pinned by sha256 in Montagio's `registry/models.lock.yaml`."
      },
